# Authentik safety

## Read-only default

List apps, providers, flows, and groups are fine when Authentik work is
authorized. Do **not**:

- delete or disable an application, provider, flow, or source
- rotate/reveal client secrets into chat
- broaden group membership or admin privileges
- change recovery/enrollment flows that weaken MFA

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

Never paste client secrets, API tokens, or user passwords into chat.
